WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.504
This is how your video automation gets set
up, once we start.

2
00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:14.568
It starts with a topic. Once we start, you
give us a short brief: the subject, your
audience and the tone. We set the system up
for your brand, so every video fits it.

3
00:00:15.368 --> 00:00:23.634
From your topic, the system writes a script.
The script then becomes the base for the
voiceover and the scenes, so everything that
follows stays on topic.

4
00:00:24.434 --> 00:00:35.347
Next, the voiceover is recorded from the
script. We choose the voice and language
with you, so it fits your brand. The timing
of the narration also guides how long each
scene stays on screen.

5
00:00:36.147 --> 00:00:45.389
Then the video is built and edited
automatically, scene by scene, with the
voiceover. It can be a short vertical video,
or a long one. You get a finished file.

6
00:00:46.189 --> 00:00:56.731
A cover image is added, and it is placed in
the very first frame of the video. This way
the cover shows up wherever the video is
posted, even when the platform has no
separate cover option.

7
00:00:57.531 --> 00:01:06.359
You review the finished video, and it is
published with its caption on TikTok,
Instagram or YouTube. We connect your
accounts for you, so you do not touch
anything technical.

8
00:01:07.159 --> 00:01:12.727
Done. Need help? Email founder at
ironvisiontools dot com.
